## Data Handling Quick Practice

1. When is it better to impute vs drop missing values?
2. Give one simple feature engineering idea for timestamp data.
3. Which scaler would you choose for KNN and why?

Answers:
1. Impute when missingness is non-trivial or informative; drop only when missingness is tiny and random.
2. Extract hour-of-day, day-of-week, and is-weekend from timestamp.
3. StandardScaler (z-score) so distances are not dominated by scale differences.

